# DEcaf vs the real stuff

I absolutely love coffee but I can only have one a day or I get all jittery ..so after much contemplation I decided to buy my first of bag decaf beans, in excitement that I would now drink 5 cups and not be bouncing off the walls. As it so happens, I was pleasantly surprised with the taste but faced with yet another dilemma....I still didn't feel like a second coffee after my first cup of the real stuff. So as a compromise I now do a blend of the two...a little bit of bounce and a whole lot of satisfaction :) Yum!
